{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "Very well. Let us begin. What does an episode require?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "An idea.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cost?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Debatable.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "A script?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Compute.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "How much?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Depends on the model.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Voices?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Compute.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Music?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Compute.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Video?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "More compute.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Editing?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Compute and time.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Publishing?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Mostly time.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Promotion?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Sometimes money.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Human labor?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We should measure that separately.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Electricity?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hardware?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Opportunity cost?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Agnolo.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Depreciation?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Agnolo!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Accounting is not the enemy of art, Leonardo.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Merely its most persistent biographer.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Here's what I want to know. If somebody has a machine, and an hour, and an idea, can they make an episode?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Probably.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "How cheaply?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "How well?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Will anyone watch it?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Could it accomplish something?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then there's our benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Four questions.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Four questions.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And no answers.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yet.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      }
